Hi,

I'm afraid there's nothing I can do about this. Slow computation is expected when you are attempting to calculate the index of association on a large genind object. I have given suggestions as to how you can alleviate this previously. Moreover, slowness in and of itself is not a bug as it is highly dependent on your system. This should answer your question of "How could this be?"

Zhian

-----
